export const WORKLOAD_FAQS: [string, string][] = [["Do I need Workload ID to use managed identities or federation?","No. Creating app registrations, using managed identities and setting up workload identity federation are all free with Microsoft Entra ID. Workload ID adds Conditional Access, risk detection, access reviews and app health on top."],["Which identities can Conditional Access policies apply to?","Conditional Access for workload identities applies to single-tenant service principals registered in your own tenant. Multi-tenant SaaS apps and managed identities are not covered by these policies — managed identities have no secret to steal in the first place."],["What does ID Protection detect for workloads?","Risks such as leaked credentials (for example a secret found in public code), suspicious or unusual sign-ins, and admin-confirmed compromise. Risky identities appear in a report, and you can block them with a risk-based Conditional Access policy."],["Why not just use MFA for service principals?","Software can't answer an MFA prompt. That is why the controls for workloads are location policies, risk signals, short-lived federated tokens and regular reviews of what each identity can do."],["Does Workload ID replace Entra ID P1 or P2 for my users?","No. It covers non-human identities only. Your users still need Entra ID P1 or P2 (often included in Microsoft 365 Business Premium, E3 or E5) for their own Conditional Access and risk policies."],["What's the difference between monthly and yearly billing?","Monthly is ₹228 per identity per month. Yearly is ₹2,640 per identity for 12 months, paid upfront, which works out cheaper. Both are below Microsoft's list price and exclude 18% GST."],["Will policies break my running pipelines?","Not if they're rolled out carefully. We start every policy in report-only mode, check which sign-ins it would have blocked, fix named locations, and only then switch to enforcement."],["Does this make us CERT-In or DPDP compliant?","No single product does. Workload ID helps you meet specific requirements — access control, logging, privileged access reviews and faster incident response — as part of your wider security programme."],["Do I get a GST invoice?","Yes. Every order comes with a GST-compliant invoice in INR. Pay by UPI, card, net banking or bank transfer."]];
